## Tool Selection Decision Tree

### User wants to work with code
- Read/write/create C# scripts → **manage_script**
- Read/write non-C# files (JSON, YAML, txt, shader, etc.) → **manage_file**
- Find symbol definitions, usages, file structure → **search_code** (requires indexing)
- Evaluate a C# expression at runtime → **execute_code** (restricted, must activate)

### User wants to operate on scene objects
- Find objects by name/tag/layer/component → **find_gameobjects**
- Create/delete/modify/reparent GameObjects → **manage_gameobject**
- Add/remove/configure components → **manage_component**
- Scene-level ops (open/save/list/hierarchy) → **manage_scene**
- Read-only analysis (health, stats, hotspots) → **scene_analysis**

### User wants to work with assets
- Search/create/delete/move asset files → **manage_asset**
- Prefab create/instantiate/apply/unpack → **manage_prefab**
- ScriptableObject CRUD → **manage_scriptable_object**
- Material create/modify/batch → **manage_material** (activate Material)
- Import settings for textures/models/generic → activate Utility category

### User wants UI work
- Legacy uGUI (Canvas/Button/Text/Image) → **manage_ui** (activate Specialized)
- UI Toolkit (UXML/USS/UIDocument) → **manage_ui_toolkit** (activate Specialized)

### User wants diagnostics/optimization
- Console errors/warnings/system info → **read_console**
- Scene performance analysis → **scene_analysis** action:find_hotspots / performance_hints
- Profiler data → **manage_profiler** (activate Extended)
- **Compilation status / recompile / wait for compile / list assemblies** → **manage_compilation** (activate meta; get_status/get_last_errors/request_compilation/wait_for_compilation/get_assemblies)
- Batch optimization (textures/meshes/audio) → **optimization** (activate Extended)
- Missing references/unused assets/duplicates → **cleaner** (activate Extended)
- **Memory snapshot / memory leak / .snap file / heap analysis** → **manage_memory_profiler** (activate Extended; take_memory_snapshot/list/analyze/diff — take+list need no external package)
- **Scene physics stats / layer collision matrix / raycast(2D) / overlap(capsule)** → **manage_physics** (activate specialized; list_scene_physics_stats / get_collision_matrix / raycast dimension=2d / overlap_test shape=capsule)

### User wants project-level operations
- Build settings/trigger build → **manage_build** (activate Extended)
- Package install/remove/list → **manage_package** (activate Extended)
- Run tests → **manage_test** (activate Extended)
- Tags/layers management → **manage_tags_layers** (activate Extended)
- Editor state/play mode/selection → **manage_editor** (rich selection via set_selection_by_query + mode=add/remove)
- **EditorPrefs / PlayerPrefs (per-user editor or app state)** → **manage_prefs** (activate meta; has/get/set/delete/delete_all — **destructive**, non-undoable)
- **SceneView pivot/size/rotation** → **manage_camera** (activate Specialized; get_scene_view / set_scene_view)
- Repetitive bulk operations → **workflow**

### User wants to store/retrieve knowledge
- Long-term cross-session memories → **manage_memory** (activate Cloud)
- Project knowledge base (RAG) → **manage_knowledge** (activate Cloud)
- Workspace config (PROJECT.md / SOUL.ext.md) → **manage_workspace_config**

